the brand in the same way?"

00:01:56.959 --> 00:01:58.845
Harold, that's a great question.

00:01:58.845 --> 00:02:00.458
I think the real answer to that

00:02:00.458 --> 00:02:02.106
needs one more layer of context.

00:02:02.106 --> 00:02:03.906
When you say, "franchising your business",

00:02:03.906 --> 00:02:05.972
building a consumer-facing business,

00:02:05.972 --> 00:02:10.747
a retailer, a QSR, a
restaurant, then franchising

00:02:10.747 --> 00:02:12.773
is a tremendous model, we've seen it from

00:02:12.773 --> 00:02:14.907
McDonald's, to Five Guys, Sonic.

00:02:14.907 --> 00:02:17.531
I mean, it's a great thing to do.

00:02:17.531 --> 00:02:20.029
It's the right business
model, or it's a phenomenal

00:02:20.029 --> 00:02:21.844
version of the right business model.

00:02:21.844 --> 00:02:23.554
You can go private, if you want.

00:02:23.554 --> 00:02:24.865
What I'm concerned about,
and what I don't know,

00:02:24.865 --> 00:02:26.506
and India, I didn't really ask you, is--

00:02:26.506 --> 00:02:28.094
Show India, everybody's
probably missing India.

00:02:28.094 --> 00:02:28.996
- Hi.

00:02:28.996 --> 00:02:32.245
- [Gary] You can get a
little camera time, Staphon.

00:02:34.685 --> 00:02:38.404
Are you going down the
route of selling your name?

00:02:38.404 --> 00:02:39.906
The reason I'm asking
that, and I don't know

00:02:39.906 --> 00:02:42.226
if you can figure it
out from the question,

00:02:42.226 --> 00:02:44.647
a lot of people try to franchise "me".

00:02:44.647 --> 00:02:46.935
I know there's a lot of
"gurus", and "advice people",

00:02:46.935 --> 00:02:48.454
where they teach the--

00:02:48.454 --> 00:02:50.395
The amount of people that pitched me,

00:02:50.395 --> 00:02:52.501
when it was at its heat, in 2010,

00:02:52.501 --> 00:02:55.739
on the idea of a "Gary
Vaynerchuk Crush It! Course",

00:02:55.739 --> 00:02:58.001
and they would be the person teaching,

00:02:58.001 --> 00:02:59.686
and they would siphon back up to me,

00:02:59.686 --> 00:03:01.902
that was something I
wasn't comfortable with.

00:03:01.902 --> 00:03:04.983
Because it wasn't something
I felt represented me

00:03:04.983 --> 00:03:07.284
and I wouldn't want to
franchise that route.

00:03:07.284 --> 00:03:09.546
So if you're asking that,
that's super uncomfortable

00:03:09.546 --> 00:03:12.929
to me, somebody representing
you, a big concern of mine.

00:03:12.929 --> 00:03:15.447
As far as a retailer or a restaurant,

00:03:15.447 --> 00:03:17.454
