Crush It! was talking about.

00:13:20.936 --> 00:13:24.584
It's a very simple thing. Cash, wealth.

00:13:24.584 --> 00:13:27.284
If you decide to make
seven pieces this year

00:13:27.284 --> 00:13:28.938
