to build up your brand.

00:13:51.469 --> 00:13:54.040
It's very simple, it's
been going on forever.

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:55.605
Independent people have always done that,

00:13:55.605 --> 00:13:57.772
Should you make pieces or
should you open a gallery?

00:13:57.772 --> 00:14:00.644
It's chicken and egg.

00:14:00.644 --> 00:14:02.193
