00:14:23.304 --> 00:14:25.949
This is the first time I've got
this kind of infrastructure.

00:14:25.949 --> 00:14:29.123
But it's just chicken and
egg, cash flow versus wealth.

00:14:29.123 --> 00:14:30.539
There's two ways to go about doing it.

00:14:30.539 --> 00:14:32.831
You can make 13 pieces and then you're

00:14:32.831 --> 00:14:34.571
